        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1#4\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   What are you laughing about...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "What are you laughing about..."
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1#4\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   If we really were going to capture you, we wouldn't have given you a chance to resist.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "If we really were going to capture you, we wouldn't have given you a chance to resist."
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Miss Misha, we really do want to help you, so...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Miss Misha, we really do want to help you, so..."
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   I don't trust you...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "I don't trust you..."
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   Lungmen treats the Infected worse than they treat criminals!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "Lungmen treats the Infected worse than they treat criminals!"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   Why would you... Why would you go out of your way to help the Infected?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "Why would you... Why would you go out of your way to help the Infected?"
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   --Miss Misha, look...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "--Miss Misha, look..."
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   What... are you doing?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "What... are you doing?"
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   ...Your...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "...Your..."
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   Your hand...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "Your hand..."
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   You're also... an Infected?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "You're also... an Infected?"
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   That's right, I'm just like you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "That's right, I'm just like you."
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   There are a lot of Infected in these slums. Those kids you left behind just now... they trusted you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "There are a lot of Infected in these slums. Those kids you left behind just now... they trusted you."
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Misha, you've already put them in danger.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Misha, you've already put them in danger."
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   ...Are you going to use those kids to threaten me?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "...Are you going to use those kids to threaten me?"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   No, I wouldn't. But someone has already started doing exactly that...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "No, I wouldn't. But someone has already started doing exactly that..."
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   We just chased off a group of thugs that was trying to threaten those kids.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We just chased off a group of thugs that was trying to threaten those kids."
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   ...!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "...!"
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Lungmen is also currently searching for the Infected. If Lungmen found you first, it might've already been too late.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Lungmen is also currently searching for the Infected. If Lungmen found you first, it might've already been too late."
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   We wanted to divert the rioters from those kids by drawing their attention to you...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We wanted to divert the rioters from those kids by drawing their attention to you..."
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Looking at it from another perspective, we'd also be able to keep you safe from harm.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Looking at it from another perspective, we'd also be able to keep you safe from harm."
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   ...Do you know why they're after me?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "...Do you know why they're after me?"
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[name=\"Misha\"]   What reason do you have... to do all this for me?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Misha",
        "content": "What reason do you have... to do all this for me?"
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#2\", name2=\"char_012_misa_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2.png",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   We actually don't know why there are Infected targeting you...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We actually don't know why there are Infected targeting you..."
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But we do care about the safety of innocents, including you. At least, this is the best course of action for the time being. I hope that you'll be able to trust us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But we do care about the safety of innocents, including you. At least, this is the best course of action for the time being. I hope that you'll be able to trust us."
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Would you allow us to take you from here first?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Would you allow us to take you from here first?"
    },
    {
